WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.743
If you consider booking an intro meeting with Niels

00:00:02.743 --> 00:00:04.572
and maybe go on a trip with him, I

00:00:04.572 --> 00:00:07.261
would 100% recommend it, especially if you want to

00:00:07.261 --> 00:00:09.627
have someone to spar with, want a friend who

00:00:09.627 --> 00:00:12.209
can support you when things are difficult and at

00:00:12.209 --> 00:00:14.683
the same time can give you the opportunity and

00:00:14.683 --> 00:00:17.319
advice to stay on your journey, because no matter

00:00:17.319 --> 00:00:20.115
what happens, it's fantastic to have someone who can

00:00:20.115 --> 00:00:22.482
understand you and at the same time can help

00:00:22.482 --> 00:00:23.719
you on the way you are.
